From ff231c1822873adf1a999aafb53d3dff836dc7a1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DarkSharpness <2040703891@qq.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 11:30:33 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/9] [DSv4.1] Use the fused index-Q kernel in the prefill
 indexer

Prefill now shares decode's index_q_rope_pack_weights: RoPE, both fp4
roundings, the pack and head weights in one launch instead of the Triton
rope fake-quant, a second quantization and two elementwise ops
(~220 us -> ~60 us per index layer at 8192 tokens on B200).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
