From fc2795bbb5aef65b451307a8f97a97c26cfec484 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DarkSharpness <2040703891@qq.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 08:20:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 6/9] [DSv4.1] Drop the record_stream on the mHC stats input

The stats kernels read the residual on the side stream, and every
consumer joins that stream on the main stream while the residual is
still referenced. record_stream only delayed the reuse of each freed
640 MiB residual until the host caught up with the GPU; without the
host syncs in the prefill path that held 6-15 residuals at once and
pushed the allocator into expandable-segment mapping failures.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
